# 3-bed / 2-bath with a hallway spine — the classic barndo split: open
# living/kitchen/dining up front, a 4 ft hall feeding the bedrooms. Two
# secondary beds share the hall bath; the primary suite gets its own ensuite
# and walk-in. Each bedroom has its own closet (with a door); the two baths sit
# back-to-back on a shared wet wall. Interior doors are backed to a corner
# (offset) so each room keeps an unbroken wall to furnish, and a side door off
# the dining gives the house a second way out.
plan "Birch Hollow"
envelope 68 x 32
ceiling 10
program 3 bed 2 bath

# --- public band (south, y 0..15) ---
room living:  living  at 0,0   size 26 x 15
room kitchen: kitchen at 26,0  size 20 x 15
room dining:  dining  at 46,0  size 22 x 15

# --- the spine: 4 ft, ending at the master door (no dead-end stub) ---
room hall: hallway at 0,15 size 62 x 4

# --- secondary bedrooms + shared bath (west) ---
room bed1:    bedroom  at 0,19   size 13 x 13
room closet1: closet   at 13,19  size 4 x 13
room bed2:    bedroom  at 17,19  size 13 x 13
room closet2: closet   at 30,19  size 4 x 13
room bath1:   bathroom at 34,19  size 8 x 13

# --- primary suite (east): ensuite backs onto the shared bath (wet wall);
#     the walk-in fills the NE corner so the hall needn't run past it ---
room mbath:   bathroom at 42,19  size 6 x 13
room master:  bedroom  at 48,19  size 14 x 13
room mcloset: closet   at 62,15  size 6 x 17

open living - kitchen width 10
open kitchen - dining width 10
open living - hall width 4
door hall - bed1 width 3 offset 0.5
door hall - bed2 width 3 offset 0.5
door hall - bath1 width 2.67 offset 0.5
door hall - master width 3 offset 0.5
door bed1 - closet1 width 2.5 offset 0.5
door bed2 - closet2 width 2.5 offset 0.5
door master - mbath width 2.67 offset 0.5
door master - mcloset width 2.5 offset 0.5

entry living south width 3 offset 20
entry dining east width 3 offset 6
window living south width 10 offset 2
window kitchen south width 8 offset 6
window dining south width 8 offset 6
window bed1 north width 5 offset 4
window bed2 north width 5 offset 4
window master north width 6 offset 6
window bath1 north width 3 offset 2
window mbath north width 3 offset 1
